B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
B ?hit Boar_Luminous 1500
sleep 2
A ?hit LightBear 1500
B ?hit LightBear 1500
sleep 2
A expect gvar GVars_Fight_GreatTuskFight Manifestation_Finished == 1 timeout=90
B expect gvar GVars_Fight_GreatTuskFight Manifestation_Finished == 1 timeout=10

# ---- The Tusk arrives, kills Lindon, and is beaten down - half the blows from each player. It ends at 30 % in both worlds. ----
include tusk_talk.part
A expect actors 1500 contains GreatTusk timeout=120
B expect actors 1500 contains GreatTusk timeout=30
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A ?hit GreatTusk 1500
B ?hit GreatTusk 1500
A expect gvar GVars_Fight_GreatTuskFight MainFight_Finished == 1 timeout=30
B expect gvar GVars_Fight_GreatTuskFight MainFight_Finished == 1 timeout=10
A expect health $darwin cur >= 1 timeout=1

# ---- The boars and piglets, then the capture. Darwin holds the Tusk with an endless cast - on the client too. ----
# Boars and piglets within 900 only: the live expedition boar and its piglets idle ~1460 from the arena.
include tusk_talk.part
# unverified: Darwin's resolved cast action name (the substring of Mombert's AA_Flow_InfiniteSpell)
B expect ai $darwin contains InfiniteSpell timeout=30
# unverified: Darwin carries a torch at the circle like Mombert (the plan names no torch for him)
B expect ai $darwin contains torch=0 timeout=10
A ?hit Boar 900
B ?hit Boar 900
sleep 2
A ?hit NPC_Piglet 900
B ?hit NPC_Piglet 900
sleep 2
A ?hit Shadow 1500
B ?hit Shadow 1500
sleep 2
